-cid-ledagoj7> <p data-astro-cid-ledagoj7>We respond to all enquiries within 4 business hours. For urgent queries, call or WhatsApp us directly on +91 7892849005 — our team is available 7am–6pm Monday to Saturday.</p> </div> </details><details class=\"faq-item\" name=\"faq-group\" data-astro-cid-ledagoj7> <summary class=\"faq-question\" data-astro-cid-ledagoj7> Is the initial site visit really free? What does it include? <svg class=\"faq-chevron\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ledagoj7> <path d=\"M5 7.5l5 5 5-5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ledagoj7></path> </svg> </summary> <div class=\"faq-answer\" data-astro-cid-ledagoj7> <p data-astro-cid-ledagoj7>Yes, the site visit has no charge and no obligation. Our designer will measure your space, photograph areas of interest, listen to your brief, and discuss your budget range. You will receive a detailed written quote within 5 working days of the visit.</p> </div> </details> </div> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class=\"site-footer\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5> <div class=\"container footer-inner\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5> <!-- Brand --> <div class=\"footer-brand\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5> <a href=\"/\" class=\"footer-logo\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5> <span class=\"footer-logo-name\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5>Homeland Interiors</span> <span class=\"footer-logo-tag\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5>Interior Designers · Bangalore South</span> </a> <p class=\"footer-desc\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5>\nCrafting thoughtful interiors across South Bangalore since 2020. Honest timelines, no-surprise quotes, deep local knowledge.\n</p> <address class=\"footer-address\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5> Opp. Sharma Godown, Talgattapura, Kanakapura Main Road,<br data-astro-cid-35ed7um5> Bangalore — 560082 </address> <div class=\"footer-contacts\" data-astro-cid-35ed7um5> <a href=\"tel:+917892849005\" clas